The Swedish Orienteering Federation and IFK Mora Orienteering Club are pleased to welcome athletes, spectators, and families to a week of world-class mountain bike orienteering in Mora (24–30 August 2026). This event also serves as part of the **2026 CX80 World Cup (Round 3)**.

## Follow Middle Distance Live

- [Live Results](https://liveresultat.orientering.se/followfull.php?comp=37545&lang=sv)
- [Livelox (Live GPS tracking from 10:30)](https://www.livelox.com/Events/Show/199289/World-MTB-Orienteering-Championships-middle)
- [YouTube Stream (Coming soon)](https://www.youtube.com/@IOFOrienteering)
- [WMTBOC Start List (IOF Eventor)](https://eventor.orienteering.org/Events/StartList?eventId=8775&groupBy=EventClass)
- [JWMTBOC Start List (IOF Eventor)](https://eventor.orienteering.org/Events/StartList?eventId=8779&groupBy=EventClass)

## Race Programme

- **Tuesday 25 August:** Model Event (12:00–16:00) at Mora Parken
- **Wednesday 26 August:** Middle distance at Arena Hemus (first start 10:00). Opening Ceremony with *Mora Spelmanslag* at 17:00 at the Event Centre
- **Thursday 27 August:** Long distance at Arena Hemus (first start 08:00)
- **Friday 28 August:** Rest day and Public Race 1 (Long distance)
- **Saturday 29 August:** Sprint at Moraparken / Event Centre (first start 10:00) and Public Race 2 (Middle distance)
- **Sunday 30 August:** Relay at Moraparken / Event Centre (first start 10:00) and Public Race 3 (Sprint)

